        <mxCell id="title" value="PAS · sequence · 1 · Login, authenticated request, permission resolution" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1100" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caption" value="req §6 (JWT) · D11 two-layer authorization · mechanics.md §M1 (permission cache). Every other diagram assumes this gateway hop and omits it." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fontColor=#777777;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="1280" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Lifeline shapes — stick figure = actor (human role) · circle with left bar = boundary (system edge: gateway, external provider) · circle with rim arrow = control (relay, scheduler) · circle on a line = entity (datastore or broker: Postgres schema, Redis, RabbitMQ) · plain rectangle = one of the nine PAS services.     Arrows — solid filled = sync request (gRPC service-to-service per D16; REST for user or external traffic) · dashed open = response · purple open = broker publish/delivery · self-call = local work ('tx:' ⇒ commits atomically)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;spacing=8;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1580" width="1180" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nm_user" value=":Internal user" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-30" y="86" width="180" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lf_user" value="" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;participant=umlActor;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="116" width="20" height="1444" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
